{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obgob is a\u00a0auto battler roguelike, where you draft units, add items, and collect artifacts to create chaotic builds.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Break The Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obgob is a auto chess roguelike focused on creating absurd builds that break the game. Artifacts can combo with units, items and other artifacts to create the ultimate units.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Components</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts</strong> act as the team enhancers allowing the team to participate in a buff, you can get these at shops, elite battles, or beating a boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items </strong>act as unit enhancers that make units stronger, especially if they scale off the items stats. These are available from chests, and shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Units</strong> are the team of creatures you use to fight for you. These units can star up if you collect three copies of their type, from 1 star, to 2 star, to 3 star.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expected Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike map system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563730?t=1753492632","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563730/e06593a6a89b481066e79a1e7ac798b96d2c9042/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753492632","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563730/c260fa6a2b07ff50